data/twins/

# the carder agent: the briefs it was given (docs/IDEAS.md); drafts live in cards/drafts/
data/carder/

# the implementer's post-guard runs: which step of which card is done (docs/IMPLEMENTER.md)
data/implement/

# the forward test chart's daily series, one file per run (docs/FORWARD_CHART.md); rebuilt by `qlab forward-series rebuild`
data/forward_series/
data/backup/

# the overlays stage: its ledger, stored comparisons and diagnostics, hand runs' state (docs/OVERLAYS.md)
data/overlays/

# the anomaly stage: its ledger and the logs of the investigator's toolkit calls (docs/ANOMALIES.md)
data/anomalies/

# restamp ledger and hand-run state (docs/RESTAMP.md)
data/restamp/
